          "highlight_sentence_for_ai": true,
          "special_highlight_type": null
        },
        {
          "generated_prob": 0.9999901034927017,
          "sentence": "But long-term goals are often easier to sustain when they are also tied to internal reasons, such as values, curiosity, identity, or a sense of purpose.",
